--- !u!114 &538485069
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 538485067}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a8b83d63ad662d944ba772861ccd31fa, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 1705166074}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 736733444}
  dialogue:
  - Even after months, I can't help coming here every day.
  - I moved away from people.
  - Maybe I moved to a house near here to be closer to you, I don't know.
  - The price of saving the village shouldn't have been losing you.
  - When you left, I left too.
  - I became a drunkard who only drank and fought.
  - I don't know how to fix this.
  - I don't know if I want to fix it even if I know.
  - I don't care about anything anymore.
  - I miss you.
  - ...
  - ...
  - Ah..
  - I have to keep going.
  - To make sense of all this fighting and losing you.
  - I have to protect the rest of the people.
  wordSpeed: 0.02
  playerIsClose: 0
  interactIndicator: {fileID: 2029922429}
