    - target: {fileID: 7191807421602066555, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Offset.x
      value: 0.27703857
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7310112414885136742, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: interactIndicator
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1234744050}
    - target: {fileID: 7310112414885136742, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.size
      value: 13
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7310112414885136742, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[0]
      value: Welcome, son.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7310112414885136742, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[1]
      value: We couldn't get through these difficult days.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7310112414885136742, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[2]
      value: I miss those days when everyone was together.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7310112414885136742, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[3]
      value: Now we are becoming fewer and fewer.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7310112414885136742, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[4]
      value: If we don't end this misery, there will be no one left.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7310112414885136742, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[5]
      value: We are running out of people, soon there will be no soldiers to defend
        the village.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7310112414885136742, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[6]
      value: The village is running out of money in ways I can't figure out.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7310112414885136742, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[7]
      value: I hear people sneaking into the village at night.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7310112414885136742, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[8]
      value: I think they're robbers from the jungle.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7310112414885136742, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[9]
      value: I want you to go into the jungle and eliminate this gang of robbers.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7310112414885136742, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[10]
      value: It'll take your mind off things, I know it's hard.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7310112414885136742, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[11]
      value: Those who left will never come back.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7310112414885136742, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[12]
      value: But it is also our duty to protect what is left.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8377317398463906531, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8810385176468782947, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: OldMan-President
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: 80ba00fca18d8b94a889fb78caf8a45d, type: 3}
